<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>ISHIKAAAAAAAA ❤️</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff7eb3,#ff758c,#ffb199);color:white;text-align:center;overflow-x:hidden}
section{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:20px}
h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,8vw,5rem);margin:10px}
.card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);padding:25px;border-radius:25px;max-width:850px}
#countdown{display:flex;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.box{background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding:15px 20px;border-radius:20px;min-width:90px}
.num{font-size:2rem;font-weight:bold}
.reason{margin:8px;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
button{padding:14px 24px;border:none;border-radius:30px;font-size:1rem;cursor:pointer}
.heart{position:fixed;bottom:-20px;animation:f 8s linear infinite}
@keyframes f{to{transform:translateY(-110vh);opacity:0}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<section>
<div class="card">
<h1>🎂 ISHIKAAAAAAAA 🎂</h1>
<h2>Your birthday is coming...</h2>
<div id="countdown"></div>
<p>Every second gets us closer to your special day ❤️</p>
<button onclick="document.getElementById('letter').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Open Your Surprise</button>
</div>
</section>

<section id="letter">
<div class="card">
<h1>💌 A Little Note</h1>
<p>
To the girl who somehow makes ordinary days feel special,
thank you for every smile, every laugh, every memory and every moment.
This is just a tiny countdown to a very big day.
❤️
</p>
</div>
</section>

<section>
<div class="card">
<h1>✨ Reasons You're Amazing</h1>
<div class="reason">You make life more fun.</div>
<div class="reason">You make people around you smile.</div>
<div class="reason">You are effortlessly lovable.</div>
<div class="reason">You make memories unforgettable.</div>
<div class="reason">Because you're ISHIKAAAAAAAA. ❤️</div>
</div>
</section>

<section>
<div class="card">
<h1>🎉 Birthday Unlock</h1>
<p>When the countdown reaches zero, it's officially your day.</p>
<h2>Love, Raghav ❤️</h2>
</div>
</section>

<script>
const target = new Date("2026-08-06T00:00:00").getTime();
function update(){
 const now = Date.now();
 let d = target-now;
 const days=Math.floor(d/86400000);
 const hrs=Math.floor(d%86400000/3600000);
 const mins=Math.floor(d%3600000/60000);
 const secs=Math.floor(d%60000/1000);
 document.getElementById('countdown').innerHTML=`
 <div class='box'><div class='num'>${days}</div>Days</div>
 <div class='box'><div class='num'>${hrs}</div>Hours</div>
 <div class='box'><div class='num'>${mins}</div>Minutes</div>
 <div class='box'><div class='num'>${secs}</div>Seconds</div>`;
}
setInterval(update,1000);update();

setInterval(()=>{
 const h=document.createElement('div');
 h.className='heart';
 h.innerHTML='❤️';
 h.style.left=Math.random()*100+'vw';
 document.body.appendChild(h);
 setTimeout(()=>h.remove(),8000);
},500);
</script>
</body>
</html>
